qinz1yang/differential-geometry (https://github.com/qinz1yang/differential-geometry)
at commit 777299070a5529e96345e0033979706fd00c7e62.
It is distributed under Apache License 2.0. The upstream license text is
preserved at DifferentialGeometry/LICENSE. The modules appear under
DifferentialGeometry/ after the Lean module-system port described in
preparation/release/P079/MODULE-PORT.md. Original upstream source hashes and
origins are recorded in preparation/release/P079/source-provenance.json;
ported candidate hashes are recorded in the release manifest.

